{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23017","main_id":23017,"main_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","main_description":"在加尔恰身边，似乎多了一个人…","chapter_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2301701,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2301701,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":230170102,"next_line_ids":[230170104],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":12700,"speaker_text_hash":1441555336,"speaker":"迦雅","speaker_raw":"迦雅","text_hash":3792754386,"text":"这就是你之前提到的人吗？很荣幸见到您，我是迦雅，一个…嗯…跳舞的人。","raw_text":"这就是你之前提到的人吗？很荣幸见到您，我是迦雅，一个…嗯…跳舞的人。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2301701.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23017","main_id":23017,"main_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","main_description":"在加尔恰身边，似乎多了一个人…","chapter_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2301701,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2301701,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":230170104,"next_line_ids":[230170105],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3639284226,"text":"你好，加尔恰之前提到过你。","raw_text":"你好，加尔恰之前提到过你。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2301701.json"}
