{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23017","main_id":23017,"main_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","main_description":"在加尔恰身边，似乎多了一个人…","chapter_title":"加尔恰的赞歌·某人的回响","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2301701,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2301701,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":230170106,"next_line_ids":[230170107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20658,"speaker_text_hash":3708588584,"speaker":"路通","speaker_raw":"路通","text_hash":2947006290,"text":"您大可把我排除在外，小姐，我相信加尔恰先生也乐见此事。","raw_text":"您大可把我排除在外，小姐，我相信加尔恰先生也乐见此事。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2301701.json"}
